[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18362.788, "timestamp": "05:06:02", "text": "现在可以买到更好的东西了。所以，是的，是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18365.75, "timestamp": "05:06:05", "text": "这意味着你可以慢慢地建造。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18367.91, "timestamp": "05:06:07", "text": "步步。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18370.708, "timestamp": "05:06:10", "text": "是啊，所以我才喜欢有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18373.11, "timestamp": "05:06:13", "text": "每当我看到新的 YouTuber 出现时，我都会感到很开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18375.27, "timestamp": "05:06:15", "text": "进入我的聊天室或向我寻求建议或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18378.788, "timestamp": "05:06:18", "text": "我通常会说，对，总是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18382.55, "timestamp": "05:06:22", "text": "网上有很多免费模型。不要进入我的世界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18385.67, "timestamp": "05:06:25", "text": "即使你做我做过的事，或者喜欢的事，即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18387.75, "timestamp": "05:06:27", "text": "有人联系你或喜欢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18390.868, "timestamp": "05:06:30", "text": "侦察你之类的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18393.19, "timestamp": "05:06:33", "text": "记住，有时候事情并不如人所愿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18395.91, "timestamp": "05:06:35", "text": "结果和你预想的一样吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18398.628, "timestamp": "05:06:38", "text": "有时候是五五开，对吧？有时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18400.788, "timestamp": "05:06:40", "text": "它有时有效，有时无效或失败。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18405.67, "timestamp": "05:06:45", "text": "锻炼什么的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18407.59, "timestamp": "05:06:47", "text": "主要的是。你说得对，露娜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18410.31, "timestamp": "05:06:50", "text": "呃，重点应该是玩得开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18413.99, "timestamp": "05:06:53", "text": "是的，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18416.15, "timestamp": "05:06:56", "text": "我的意思是，这基本上就是我关注的重点。"}]